			title: "&9Machine Covers"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2E8BFA2E719B1C47"]
			description: [
				"&9With EMI, instead of showing you a separate recipe for every tool-resource combination, tools are instead grouped. You can use any tool from that group - for example, the &6#forge:tools/hammers &9group means that any &aHammer &9can be used there."
				""
				"First, make a &aHammer&f (not a &aMining Hammer&f, mind you… six ingots, not plates). Hammers can be used to turn &etwo ingots into one plate&f. &6Plates&f can make a &3File&f, Files can make &6Rods&f, etc. Use EMI to work your way down the list of tools."
				""
				"&6Wrought Iron&f is probably your best bet for a tool material right now, but better materials will become available as you progress."
			]
